      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1370402331,
      "text": "Faurea saligna is a graceful, semi-deciduous tree in the family Proteaceae. It grows to about 10 metres (33 ft), or up to 20 metres (66 ft) under forest conditions. Found from tropical Africa south to the Transvaal, Swaziland and Natal, often in large communities on sandy soil and along stream beds."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Faurea saligna",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faurea_saligna",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 151823403,
      "text": "Faurea saligna es un elegante árbol semi-caducifolio de la familia Proteaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Faurea saligna",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faurea_saligna",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 224792839,
      "text": "Faurea saligna est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Proteaceae. C'est un arbre gracieux à feuilles semi-décidues."
    }
